y"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 42 of them on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids. In 2025 that middle sat at 15% for February to March and 203% for August to September. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 15% on the middle. Grid 20224 had its driest year in 1954 at 44%.</p>"}
